{
  "name": "tube_house",
  "doc": "A tube house (nhà ống) of Vũng Tàu, built as on a real site: the footings and the ground slab, then floor by floor the columns, the beams and the slab of reinforced concrete, the infill of bricks laid in three bands of courses by many masons at one time on each wall, the stair, the rail of the balcony, the plaster and the paint, the doors, the windows and the shutter, and the roof. The origin is on the ground at the center of the lot; the front is to +y.",
  "sources": [
    "The frame and the infill of a tube house of Việt Nam: TCVN 5574:2018 (concrete), TCVN 1451:1998 (bricks), TCVN 4451:2012 (the stair); the sizes of each part are estimates of a house of two to four floors."
  ],
  "params": [
    {
      "name": "name",
      "type": "text",
      "default": "nha_ong",
      "max": 40,
      "doc": "The name of the model: a to z, 0 to 9 and _."
    },
    {
      "name": "width",
      "type": "number",
      "default": 4.0,
      "min": 2.5,
      "max": 12.0,
      "unit": "m",
      "doc": "The front of the lot."
    },
    {
      "name": "depth",
      "type": "number",
      "default": 16.0,
      "min": 4.0,
      "max": 40.0,
      "unit": "m",
      "doc": "The lot from the front to the back."
    },
    {
      "name": "floors",
      "type": "integer",
      "default": 3,
      "min": 1,
      "max": 8
